                "step_name": "Run module core imports gate"
            },
            "help": "Check that module code only imports from quickscale_core.runtime\n(not from internal subpackages like dr_engine, contracts, manifest, etc.).\nPer-module legacy exceptions exist for billing/crm adapter seams only.",
